Bring in "sys" as sys.

Note: The Sentinel - A professional file organizer.

Print "Running Sentinel...".
Create folder "Images".
Create folder "Documents".

List files in "." as files.

For each file in files:
    If file ends with ".jpg":
        Print "Found image, moving...".
        Move file to "Images/file".
    
    If file ends with ".pdf":
        Print "Found document, moving...".
        Move file to "Documents/file".

Print "Organization complete.".
